### 1. Fix the @Transactional + @Async Conflict (C-2)
You cannot have @Async and @Transactional on the exact same method, because the transaction gets left behind when Spring spawns the new background thread. We must split the method into two: one to start the background thread, and a separate one to manage the strict Oracle transaction.
